<title>USA: CBOE to trade options on Tele-Save on Thursday.</title>
<headline>CBOE to trade options on Tele-Save on Thursday.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Chicago Board Options Exchange (CBOE) will trade options on Tele-Save Holdings Inc on Thursday, March 27, the exchange said.</p>
<p>Tele-Save, located in New Hope, Pa., is a provider of long-distance telecommunication services to small- and medium-sized businesses.</p>
<p>Options on Tele-Save will trade on the January expiration cycle, with initial strike prices at 12-1/2, 15 and 17-1/2.</p>
<p>((Derivatives desk 312-408-8750))E-mail derivatives@reuters.com</p>
</text>
